      "id": "claim_c66e6255cac74e38bc7a029a07141a03",
      "statement": "BossHelper (boss-helper) is a browser extension (WXT + Vue 3 + Nuxt UI 4 + Tailwind CSS 4, built with Bun, targeting chrome/edge/firefox MV3) that automates job filtering and resume delivery on Boss直聘 (zhipin.com) by injecting a Vue panel into the job-list page and running a task pipeline over the host page's job data.",
