      "statement": "The extension is split into four runtime worlds with disjoint capabilities: the background service worker owns browser APIs, cross-origin fetch, notifications, storage and IDB; the ISOLATED content script injects /boss.js; the MAIN-world unlisted script owns the host page window and Vue root; and the options page runs the full Vue UI with initExtensionCounter().",
