      "id": "claim_6885e9aaac99477e8a29802126e9fd6e",
      "statement": "Business code never touches browser.* directly: the comctx proxy façade `counter` in src/message forwards every storage/network call across worlds, with initCounter() wiring the MAIN-world script to the content script and initExtensionCounter() wiring the options page straight to background; the namespaces are __boss-helper-content__ and __boss-helper-background__, accessing counter.xxx before initialization throws, and storage keys without an explicit local:/session:/sync:/managed: prefix fall into the sync area.",
