      "id": "claim_014a703dd297484b9d7436d967d4ae2e",
      "statement": "The Boss-specific assembly is HelperContext (abstract: owns conf, accounts, models, statistics, chatModel, HelperCache, JobResultCache, workflow, logs and is injected into the Vue panel via HelperKey) + BossHelperCtx (hooks the host Vue jobList/pageVo/hasMore/jobDetail/pageChangeAction, fetches detail by simulated card click, sends chat via MQTT, then run() mounts the boss-helper-job custom element) + bossWorkflow (declares the ordered task pipeline).",
