      "id": "claim_93166ed93b034f3ea28efe0ce536672c",
      "statement": "Storage keys without an explicit local:/session:/sync:/managed: prefix are silently routed to the sync area by genKey() in ContentCounter, which gives a smaller quota and roams with the user's browser account; adding a prefix to an existing key therefore amounts to an un-migrated storage-area move.",
