    {
      "id": "claim_58662e11e42d49f79f694931014a0549",
      "statement": "The `counter` façade in src/message/index.ts is a Proxy that throws 'Counter has not been initialized...' on any get/set while _counter is null, so initCounter() (MAIN-world injected script) and initExtensionCounter() (options page) must run before business modules evaluate; ExtStorage.getItem is the one exception, polling every 200ms for _counter and therefore pending forever if it never appears.",
